Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Let's go back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger! Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi! Draw the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the richest person in the\Nworld - Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, tell Kraken to get away from here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, Surume!\N--Wait, don't need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running like hell already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a terrible look for\Nsuch a mythical monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Maybe we can hit it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He runs awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that. That's how\Nhorrifying the eruption is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,--Come on!\N--It's rehab!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wanna see the eruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--Evacuate to the front of the ship!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't change anything!\NIt's only a few meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava's flowing along to the sea floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature is soaring!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm in boiling water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be cooked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost ship and the Sea Bonze!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:04:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go faster, Surume, or you're\Ngonna become boiled octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Boiled octopus? That's\Ngreat! I wanna eat some!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the difference in temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nthe sea current's starting to swirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.68,0:04:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nthe sea current's starting to swirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,which way is the Fish-Man Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,\NSanji, you have to focus on your rehab!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump into that trench!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sheer cliff! You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's darker than dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's darker than dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that the\NFish-Man Island is in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.35,0:05:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally dark in the front! Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there'll be another monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can make it home alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! The darkness is a bottomless\Npot that connects to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron pot! Tea caddy! Tea-tea caddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump in, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.63,0:05:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's erupting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?! Right above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,--Rocks?!\N--Mud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,--Rocks?!\N--Mud?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an avalanche of rocks and earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out and cut them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hold on tightly to my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:05:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, let me go!\N--Why are you stopping him, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, let me go!\N--Why are you stopping him, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're 8,000 meters deep now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go out, you'll be crushed\Nby the water pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can buy some time to\Nget away from the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can buy some time to\Nget away from the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure Kill; Green Star...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,..."Sargasso"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,--It stopped...\N--...The avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.85,0:06:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was great judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was fooling\Naround for the past 2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Surume, you did great too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--We're safe now!\N--Thank you, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Surume! Surume! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Surume! Hey! Surume! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Su...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,2000)}10,000 METERS BELOW SEA LEVEL "THE DEEP"\N(THE BOTTOM OF THE OCEANIC TRENCH)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Light? This deep in the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright! My eyes are dazzled!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have eyes to be dazzled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see it--it's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Nami, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no doubt.\NThe needle is pointing at the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fish-Man Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in a big bubble! There are\Nclouds? Maybe there is air inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a popular site in the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mermaids dance around\Nhere. The beautiful Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The paradise that I've been\Ndreaming of since I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaido! Mermaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaido! Mermaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermai...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! You're not ready!\NYou shouldn't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:08:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji! The rehab didn't work yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't look at real Mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor! It was his dream to see the\NMermaids on the Fish-Man Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's gonna die if he sees them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than live longer without a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna die staring at the\NMermaids in a disgusting way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna look at the Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,--He's burning!\N--The flame of his eroticism!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait! I wonder what\Nkind of meat is in their dishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait! I wonder what\Nkind of meat is in their dishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wipe your drool.\NCan you give an order to Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:10:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The group of sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead! After we got all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so cool! The sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's riding it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right in middle of the sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the Straw Hats, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you? How do you know about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know you all very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the ones who foiled the\Nplans of the Arlong Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That act was easy enough to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you stood up for Hachi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nthe former officer of the Arlong Pirates 2 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and knocked one of the hateful\NCelestial Dragons out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Fisher Tiger, the hero of\Nthe Fish-Man Island who we respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}THE NEW FISH-MAN PIRATES - FIGHTER HAMMOND
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to decide what I should do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tell me. Are you guys our enemies or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}THE NEW FISH-MAN PIRATES – ASSASSIN HYOUZOU
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}THE NEW FISH-MAN PIRATES - FIGHTER KASAGON
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna enlist under our banner -
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.09,0:11:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the New Fish-Man Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, we'll sink you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, fuel up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that Luffy and the\Nothers won't give in to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're 10,000 meters deep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even fight and\Nthere's no chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So we run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the Coup de Burst using all the air we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nhave and charge into the Fish-Man Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we are all gonna\Ndie after coming this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like that's the\Nonly way that we can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll fill it up. Franky, steer the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, super count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are not so clever anyway.\NIt's no use doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you wanna work under us, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You refused... the offer to join\Nthe New Fish-Man Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you guys are the Fish-Men's\Nenemy! Just sinful human beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we work under you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't rub them the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame. Then we can't\Nlet you pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we sink you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done! Franky, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny is a lion too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight someday, Sea Lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing air...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get crushed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe! But I don't have lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Endure it! Until we reach the Fish-Man Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, my dear Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The coating came off!\NIt got stuck on the giant bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble here is a double structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal ships will fall in this\Nlayer because there is only air!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run into one\Nmore bubble! Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The current is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 4 Devil Fruit eaters but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Robin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! I can't swim against the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a crazy way to get in there.\NMaybe they tried to self-destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna go after them, Hammond?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,\NI don't know if they're still alive though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want Neptune's army to find them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, let's go back to\NNoah and let Boss know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...Straw Hat who shattered\NArlong-san's ambition is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie! It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten prettier, Camie-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.45,0:17:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, long time no see!\NI'm glad to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie is here - that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We landed on the Fishman Island?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:17:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been told that we were
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.32,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,\Ndrowning but some Mermaids rescued us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, we just woke up a couple minutes ago too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Camie-chan's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Camie's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna pick you guys up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but I thought it was a month later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.23,0:18:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it looks like we got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was following them up to some point
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nbut they were taken somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure they'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so. The bone can't do much in the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but they got the robot and the\Ngreen one so they'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.11,0:18:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the others too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here! I know you're all freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:19:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I made soup so have some and get warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah! Cold seaweed soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.47,0:19:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get warm with\Ncold soup! What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Camie-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It warms me up anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,--They are dry.\N--They aren't dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,--Maybe they are dry.\N--They are dry, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You dried our clothes! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:20:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're my friends.\NThe Medaka Mermaid Quintuplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm Ichika!\N--I'm Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm Sanka!\N--I'm Yonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yonka Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.78,0:20:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't it be Goka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They swim fast and they're pretty savvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the sea floor of the Mermaid Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the girls' dorm for the Mermaid Cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have a lot of friends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,G... G... G...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls' dorm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.35,0:20:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What... what... What is Mermaid Cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cafe where I'm working as a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of beautiful Mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,B-Beautiful Mermaids?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a cup of coffee? Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sanji is...\N--...In danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Dammit!\N--He endured!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore that I'd never have\Na nosebleed and pass out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...on the Fish-Man Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So I should be rewarded by now, shouldn't I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How desperate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, let's go up!\NI want you to meet my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Sea Turtle Elevator."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtle-chin, take us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a coral apartment in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The dorm is at the very\Nbottom so the rent is cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The top floor gets natural light\Nso it's the most expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you poor? By the way,\Nwhere are Hachi and Pappagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.35,0:21:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-chin got severely\Ninjured about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to protect the Sunny at Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that he's pretty much recovered now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.69,0:22:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but Ha-chin is originally from the Fish-Man District so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he's resting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish-Man District?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kind of a rough area
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can take you there since\NI feel safe with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go later! I have to\Nthank him face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.75,0:22:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it! And Pappagu is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.30,0:22:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a very famous designer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so he has a big mansion in Fishverly\NHills, the high-class district.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna deliver clams\Nthere today so come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your pet, right?\NWhy don't you live with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That area is way beyond my means.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have better clams here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that straw-like thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Water Road that a bubble craftsman made.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We and the fish get in and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here, on the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I can even swim in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.85,0:23:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides that, there's a sky\Nand clouds in the deep sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! I wonder how it's possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Camie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.04,0:23:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's a girl's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your friends fine now?\NThe pirates who were drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.09,0:23:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't come in by the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.09,0:23:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! You guys don't look that scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.43,0:23:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys entered illegally?\NSo wild! I love pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a living fairy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.45,0:24:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A land of coral! The Mermaid Cove!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.34,0:24:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's crying harder than\Nwhen he left the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.97,0:24:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.31,0:24:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my All Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.94,0:24:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really what you want, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.57,0:24:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce them to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.99,0:24:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the captain - Luffy-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The crying one is Sanji-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the nose - Usopp-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The racoon is Chopper-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.13,0:25:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.42,0:25:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me! Let's dance in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.72,0:25:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I get it now. This is too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably gonna die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.07,0:25:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How negative!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what happened to you in the past 2 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the paradise that\Nyou've been dreaming of!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.66,0:25:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's not trying to be funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.53,0:25:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:26:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the undersea volcano's gonna erupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Surume?!\NWe were almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying that won't help!\NHang on! Don't get thrown off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, let's go back to\NNoah and let Boss know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...Straw Hat who shattered\NArlong-san's ambition is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher... Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:17:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}THE NEW FISH-MAN PIRATES - FIGHTER HAMMOND
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'll look.\N--I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Maybe I'll look.\N--I looked, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--He moved!\N--He didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,--Maybe he moved.\N--He moved, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy-chin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.73,0:25:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy finally got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the undersea volcano's gonna erupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.73,0:01:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We are too close to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san is harsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Surume, you did great too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea plant popped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It only holds for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the chance to get away, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you obeying such fools as humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kraken!
